  serializedStrings:
  - Key: en.e2ae1c70a3e94b8ba1cb53fc664055aa.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.e2ae1c70a3e94b8ba1cb53fc664055aa.text
    Value: "\u2026Finally awake."
  - Key: en.c619f4c6fe4c409199ac55ff37b24160.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.c619f4c6fe4c409199ac55ff37b24160.text
    Value: It takes a little longer, every time.
  - Key: en.140466d37ae94f788e3731b2f5bc9847
    Value: ...How did I die?
  - Key: en.7309440e2edd4bd6b833e57a0d38cebe.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.7309440e2edd4bd6b833e57a0d38cebe.text
    Value: Like a fool.
  - Key: en.6a899ed4e0df45c6b76cf6ae796612d7.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.6a899ed4e0df45c6b76cf6ae796612d7.text
    Value: And yet how many times more, I wonder.
  - Key: en.1dc2011bc4024cb0b0e48032a5c76514
    Value: As many as it takes.
  - Key: en.1b384a7c8b8e46ea82ba65c5b1576086.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.1b384a7c8b8e46ea82ba65c5b1576086.text
    Value: "That\u2019s the spirit "
  - Key: en.e3118fa9412f4670bbe8bcee41229706
    Value: "I know you\u2026 but I can't seem to remember why."
  - Key: en.e242a0cb5d6e4a5fb10f8ff8faa41de9
    Value: So.. What have I missed?
  - Key: en.62f573d5f446484abd097182dad7156e
    Value: She visited my dream.
  - Key: en.1f570357d606497e83551fcc452c42d8
    Value: End
  - Key: en.8160d5a835b442e187725386853f5039.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.8160d5a835b442e187725386853f5039.text
    Value: "\u2026 I'm Morghaine."
  - Key: en.9d601ec24ab84bd987a69e036d443dc9.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.9d601ec24ab84bd987a69e036d443dc9.text
    Value: A shadow.
  - Key: en.fe6b5431c6d343a8a6fe5e21cb2f29a9.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.fe6b5431c6d343a8a6fe5e21cb2f29a9.text
    Value: ...Though very little light remains.
  - Key: en.bfc938f6ce07426695be1664691c59c5.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.bfc938f6ce07426695be1664691c59c5.text
    Value: Not much.
  - Key: en.81c41a0e6d8b402188b35fce5bbf6fdc.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.81c41a0e6d8b402188b35fce5bbf6fdc.text
    Value: "Truth be told, I couldn\u2019t say if it were hours or years. "
  - Key: en.230d98950d0441ea8b08ceb86f6827a2.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.230d98950d0441ea8b08ceb86f6827a2.text
    Value: 'And yet this timing cannot be by chance. '
  - Key: en.2fe464f818bd4eebaf4b87c7f84a7152.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.2fe464f818bd4eebaf4b87c7f84a7152.text
    Value: The air above has shifted. Smells like blood and brass.
  - Key: en.ce1fd699d53b40769ea7b155193e65c3.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.ce1fd699d53b40769ea7b155193e65c3.text
    Value: "They must know we\u2019re coming."
  - Key: en.4b065f3a09914382b2d4a08caa97dc0a.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.4b065f3a09914382b2d4a08caa97dc0a.text
    Value: "So\u2026 she still speaks."
  - Key: en.0c1ad06172f6470e9acd4d1247f71dfd.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.0c1ad06172f6470e9acd4d1247f71dfd.text
    Value: Just echoes, I should think. She sees so very little now.
  - Key: en.7497a9ae6e734a70b110380f8736c9ab.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.7497a9ae6e734a70b110380f8736c9ab.text
    Value: ...And how could she not, from so far above?
  - Key: en.e8612fa291544bacbecb4123748c5202
    Value: "You\u2019re probably right."
  - Key: en.88dd0ecb564f4b0399e85be29b621057.title
    Value: Dialogue
  - Key: en.88dd0ecb564f4b0399e85be29b621057.text
    Value: Well then, I need my sword.
  - Key: en.e11bd946c13a4c6f96e3380d97d18207.value
    Value: Knight
  - Key: en.a5e7778b5e134c21b1d77b964913ab18.value
    Value: Event_Tower
